Treatment Plan Timeliness Tracker for Clinical Notes Analyzer\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Product Name\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Working Product Name:
\f1\b0  IZ Clinical Notes Analyzer \'96 Treatment Plan Timeliness Tracker\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. Product Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The purpose of this product is to help R3 Recovery Services track whether treatment plans for active clients are completed within required timelines, with particular focus on:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Initial Treatment Plans completed on admission day.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Master Treatment Plans completed within 30 days of admission.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ongoing Treatment Plan Reviews completed on the correct recurring schedule based on level of care.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Immediate Treatment Plan Reviews when a client changes level of care.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Clear dashboard visibility into compliant, due-soon, urgent, and overdue treatment plan work.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The immediate product goal is not to analyze every aspect of clinical note quality. The first useful version should focus on 
\f0\b date-based treatment plan timeliness
\f1\b0  because that is the area the office manager currently tracks manually and repeatedly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. Background and Business Context\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The office manager currently reviews client charts in Alleva and manually tracks treatment plan due dates in Asana. The process requires checking multiple chart locations:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
